      "updated": 1785910337393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Among Us (game type)\n\nThe among is game type is just two phases\n- A Movement phase:\n  where players must complete tasks,\n  kill others, run around etc\n- Voting Phase\n  Players just sit around and talk ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Among Us (game type)\n\nThe among is game type is just two phases\n- A Movement phase:\n  where players must complete tasks,\n  kill others, run around etc\n- Voting Phase\n  Players just sit around and talk ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
